{
    "chapter_num": 24,
    "verses_count": 31,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Divisions of the Priests"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "these are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the divisions of the sons of Aaron. The sons of Aaron "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Nadab and Abihu died before their father, and had no children; therefore Eleazar and Ithamar ministered as priests. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David with Zadok of the sons of Eleazar, and Ahimelech of the sons of Ithamar, divided them according to the schedule of their service."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There were more leaders found of the sons of Eleazar than of the sons of Ithamar, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "thus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they were divided. Among the sons of Eleazar "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sixteen heads of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " fathers’ houses, and eight heads of their fathers’ houses among the sons of Ithamar. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus they were divided by lot, one group as another, for there were officials of the sanctuary and officials "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of the house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of God, from the sons of Eleazar and from the sons of Ithamar. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the scribe, Shemaiah the son of Nethanel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Levites, wrote them down before the king, the leaders, Zadok the priest, Ahimelech the son of Abiathar, and the heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the priests and Levites, one father’s house taken for Eleazar and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for Ithamar."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the first lot fell to Jehoiarib, the second to Jedaiah, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the third to Harim, the fourth to Seorim, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the fifth to Malchijah, the sixth to Mijamin, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the seventh to Hakkoz, the eighth to Abijah, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the ninth to Jeshua, the tenth to Shecaniah, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the eleventh to Eliashib, the twelfth to Jakim, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the thirteenth to Huppah, the fourteenth to Jeshebeab, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the fifteenth to Bilgah, the sixteenth to Immer, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the seventeenth to Hezir, the eighteenth to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX, Vg. Aphses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Happizzez, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the nineteenth to Pethahiah, the twentieth to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "MT Jehezkel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jehezekel, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the twenty-first to Jachin, the twenty-second to Gamul, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the twenty-third to Delaiah, the twenty-fourth to Maaziah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the schedule of their service for coming into the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to their ordinance by the hand of Aaron their father, as the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel had commanded him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Other Levites"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the rest of the sons of Levi: of the sons of Amram, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shebuel, 1 Chr. 23:16"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shubael; of the sons of Shubael, Jehdeiah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Concerning Rehabiah, of the sons of Rehabiah, the first "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Isshiah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the Izharites, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shelomith, 1 Chr. 23:18"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shelomoth; of the sons of Shelomoth, Jahath. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Supplied from 23:19 (following some Heb. mss. and LXX mss.)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Hebron"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", Jeriah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was the first,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jekameam the fourth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Uzziel, Michah; of the sons of Michah, Shamir. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The brother of Michah, Isshiah; of the sons of Isshiah, Zechariah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Merari "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mahli and Mushi; the son of Jaaziah, Beno. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Merari by Jaaziah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Beno, Shoham, Zaccur, and Ibri. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of Mahli: Eleazar, who had no sons. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of Kish: the son of Kish, Jerahmeel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the sons of Mushi "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mahli, Eder, and Jerimoth. These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of the Levites according to their fathers’ houses."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These also cast lots just as their brothers the sons of Aaron did, in the presence of King David, Zadok, Ahimelech, and the heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the priests and Levites. The chief fathers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "did"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " just as their younger brethren."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}